>OBLONG-CORDATE <BR>POMPOUS PERSON <BR>PURPLE-SPOTTED <BR>RE-REITERATION <BR>RE-REQUIREMENT <BR>RE-RESTORATION <BR>SASSAFRAS PITH <BR>SAUSAGE-SHAPED <BR>SEASIDE SPURGE <BR>THAT IS TO SAY <BR>ASSASSINATRESS <BR>ATLANTOMASTOID <BR>ATRABILIARIOUS <BR>CALCANEOCUBOID <BR>CIRCUMLOCUTORY <BR>COXCOMBICALITY <BR>ENTEROPNEUSTAL <BR>ENTEROPNEUSTAN <BR>ENTEROSTENOSIS <BR>INDIGESTIBILTY <BR>INSIGNIFICANCE <BR>INSIGNIFICANCY <BR>NONNATIONALISM <BR>OPPOSITIONISTS <BR>OPPOSITIONLESS <BR>REFRACTORINESS <BR>RETRANSCRIBING <BR>RETROMIGRATION <BR>RETROSERRULATE <BR>SENSUALISATION <BR>TESTAMENTARILY <BR>TESTAMENTATION <BR>UNCUMBROUSNESS <BR>UNGUILEFULNESS <BR>UNHUMOROUSNESS <BR>UNLUMINOUSNESS <BR>UNMUTINOUSNESS <BR>UNNUMEROUSNESS <BR>UNTUMULTUOUSLY <BR> <BR> <BR>================================== <BR>Match hyphenated phrases <BR>match repeated letters found in code <BR>GBSOAP-TNLTRDEITBSFAV <BR>      -T  T    T <BR>================================== <BR>C&#42;CK-A-DOODLE--DOOING <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
