<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11876"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sidewalker<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sidewalker<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, March 20, 2005 - 5:41 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Probably someone already noticed this, but the number 7 in the puzzle is the 7th &#42;figure&#42; in the puzzle and the number 14 is the 14th from the dash. <BR>Maybe those are not part of the puzzle?&#40;fill, I think someone said before&#41; <BR>not much help, if that works.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
